5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,000
Sorry brother, I don't have change.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,800
"Are you here? ❤️"

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,000
No change, brother.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Allô?

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,800
In Morocco, there are small problems...
but they can stop big moments.

10
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:45,500
God bless you, my son.

11
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,600
Allo Floussi... we bring you the change,
you keep your moment going.
